#. module: account_payment_authorization_reconcile
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_payment_authorization_reconcile.field_account_move__authorization_number
msgid ""
"Authorization Number of the customer payment or receipt voucher this "
"journal entry originates from (including payments generated by Point of "
"Sale). Shown here for visibility and used by the bank reconciliation engine "
"to automatically match this entry with the corresponding bank statement "
"line."
msgstr ""
"Número de autorización del comprobante de pago o de ingreso del cliente del "
"que procede este asiento contable (incluidos los pagos generados por el "
"punto de venta). Se muestra aquí a efectos informativos y es utilizado por "
"el motor de conciliación bancaria para emparejar automáticamente este "
"asiento con la línea correspondiente del extracto bancario."

#. module: account_payment_authorization_reconcile
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/account_payment_authorization_reconcile/static/src/app/utils/order_payment_validation.js:0
msgid "Authorization Number required"
msgstr "Se requiere un número de autorización"

#. module: account_payment_authorization_reconcile
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_payment_authorization_reconcile.field_account_bank_statement_line__authorization_number
msgid ""
"Authorization or approval number reported by the bank for this transaction, "
"as copied from the bank statement (Excel/CSV import or bank connection). It "
"is used to automatically match this bank statement line with the "
"corresponding customer payment during the bank reconciliation."
msgstr ""
"Número de autorización o aprobación facilitado por el banco para esta "
"transacción, tal y como figura en el extracto bancario (importación en "
"formato Excel/CSV o conexión bancaria). Se utiliza para hacer coincidir "
"automáticamente esta línea del extracto bancario con el pago "
"correspondiente del cliente durante la conciliación bancaria."

#. module: account_payment_authorization_reconcile
#: model:ir.model,name:account_payment_authorization_reconcile.model_account_bank_statement_line
msgid "Bank Statement Line"
msgstr "Línea de un estado de cuenta bancario"

#. module: account_payment_authorization_reconcile
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_payment_authorization_reconcile.field_pos_payment__authorization_number
msgid ""
"Bank authorization or approval number for this Point of Sale payment (card, "
"bank transfer, etc.). It is propagated to the resulting accounting entry so "
"it can be used to automatically match it with the corresponding bank "
"statement line."
msgstr ""
"Número de autorización o aprobación bancaria para este pago en el punto de "
"venta (tarjeta, transferencia bancaria, etc.). Se traslada al asiento "
"contable resultante, de modo que puede utilizarse para relacionarlo "
"automáticamente con la partida correspondiente del extracto bancario."

#. module: account_payment_authorization_reconcile
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_payment_authorization_reconcile.field_account_payment__authorization_number
msgid ""
"Bank authorization or approval number provided for an electronic customer "
"payment (bank transfer, credit/debit card, payment link, etc.). It is used "
"by the bank reconciliation engine to automatically match this payment with "
"the corresponding bank statement line."
msgstr ""
"Número de autorización o aprobación bancaria facilitado para un pago "
"electrónico de un cliente (transferencia bancaria, tarjeta de crédito o "
"débito, enlace de pago, etc.). El motor de conciliación bancaria lo utiliza "
"para asociar automáticamente dicho pago con la partida correspondiente del "
"extracto bancario."

#. module: account_payment_authorization_reconcile
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_payment_authorization_reconcile.field_account_voucher__authorization_number
msgid ""
"Bank authorization or approval number provided for an electronic customer "
"receipt (bank transfer, credit/debit card, payment link, etc.). It is used "
"by the bank reconciliation engine to automatically match this voucher with "
"the corresponding bank statement line."
msgstr ""
"Número de autorización o aprobación bancaria facilitado para un recibo "
"electrónico del cliente (transferencia bancaria, tarjeta de crédito/débito, "
"enlace de pago, etc.). El motor de conciliación bancaria lo utiliza para "
"asociar automáticamente este comprobante con la partida correspondiente del "
"extracto bancario."

